□ Dual-author footer present? → R-GENIE framework + agent author lines in every file.
□ `author:` field uses agent author name (from Phase 0)? → If NO, fix now.
□ **TOOL-FIRST GUARD (Gap #15):** Am I about to run `sed`/`awk`/`cat >`/`echo >>` to mutate a `.mdc`/`.md`/`.yaml`/`.json` file? → STOP. Use `read_file` + `edit`/`multi_edit`/`write_to_file` tools instead. Shell-based content mutation is FORBIDDEN for critical files.
