□ **EDIT-SIZE GUARD (Gap #16):** Am I about to produce a single `edit`/`write_to_file` operation exceeding ~300 lines? → STOP. Split into skeleton-first + per-section bounded appends using Progressive Documentation Pattern (Technique #20). Each edit ≤300 lines. See `@01_Guidance.mdc` §10.
□ **PROGRESSIVE DOC v2 PHASE 0 ASSESSMENT GUARD (v1.5.0):** Did I run the Progressive Documentation v2 Assessment in Phase 0? → If NO, go back to Phase 0. Set `progressiveDocV2: true` for any multi-phase agent producing a structured deliverable (DEFAULT). Set `progressiveDocV2: false` only for single-phase short-form agents. Set `exampleAnchorPath` when applicable (path to canonical example output for verbosity benchmarking).
□ **PROGRESSIVE DOC v2 EMBEDDING GUARD (v1.5.0 — for generated agents):** If `progressiveDocV2: true`, did I embed ALL of these in the generated agent?
