  — Guidance: Adapted Section 10 (Five Mechanics + Skeleton Convention + Per-Phase Write Contract Template + Example-Anchored Conciseness)
  — Stop Points: PER-PHASE WRITE SELF-CHECK block (5 bullets — see Pattern #20 v2 in `lib/docs/prompt-engineering-patterns.md`)
  — Main Entry: References to Critical Rule #6 (Progressive File Writing) AND Critical Rule #7 (Template-First/Example-Based)
  — Quality Checklist: Example-Anchored Conciseness item referencing `exampleAnchorPath`
