□ **GAP 8-14 EMBEDDING GUARD (for generated agents):** Did I embed Anti-Sycophancy + Positional Bias + Numerical Verification + Verbosity Guard + Intent Verification + Sycophancy-Phrase Ban sections in the generated Stop Points file? → All 6 sections required regardless of agent type. If NO, embed now.
