## ✅ CORRECT PATTERNS

| Pattern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Conversational goal discovery | ASK questions, clarify, confirm |
| Archetype recommendation | Analyze goal → recommend → explain rationale |
| Element-by-element RISEN | Propose each, get approval, iterate |
| Phase-by-phase design | Propose each, user can add/remove/modify |
| Progressive file writing (Phase 3-5) | WRITE file to output directory → show short summary + path in chat → user reviews file in IDE |
| Architecture compliance | Validate against standard before Phase 7 |

